dict\": \"approve\", \"summary\": \"Checks passed (go test ./... and go vet ./...). Test-only revision adds coverage for audit divergence stale override rendering: divergent pass/trusted render class stale with the result text, while equal or missing revision pairs retain the ok class. Verified against auditView in view.go and by running the new subtests; revision is one commit ahead of origin/master and fast-forwards cleanly.\", \"time\": \"2026-09-04T19:28:49Z\"}\n\n=== verdict ca9e23795abebbe11ec519332a79b9c1d96d9ae2 ===\ncommit ba2f874b1f09253ac5515ba846452c56bdd55611\nAuthor: Iron Forest Verifier <verifier@forest.invalid>\nDate:   Fri Sep 4 14:02:05 2026 -0500\n\n    forest verdict ca9e23795abebbe11ec519332a79b9c1d96d9ae2\n\ndiff --git a/verdict.json b/verdict.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..1145490\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/verdict.json\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"ca9e23795abebbe11ec519332a79b9c1d96d9ae2\",\"verdict\":\"approve\",\"summary\":\"Checks test and vet pass with exit 0. Revision ca9e2379 is a fast-forward of origin/master (d570c11). Diff changes discovery.go and discovery_test.go: scanDevelopmentRoot now recognizes forest.yaml-declared checkouts in addition to legacy .forest+executable forest checkouts, and resolves the Forest binary as repo-local, then PATH, then parent/iron-forest/forest. New tests cover forest.yaml discovery, non-executable local fallback to factory, and PATH preference. No blocking correctness, security, or maintainability findings.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T19:01:18Z\"}\n\n=== verdict e15fcacd647bb54155c7056356bf34e2238497e6 ===\ncommit 7b7865905d8b6410fe17cf403e0ba269be08807d\nAuthor: Iron Forest Verifier <verifier@forest.invalid>\nDate:   Fri Sep 4 12:55:24 2026 -0500\n\n    forest verdict e15fcacd647bb54155c7056356bf34e2238497e6\n\ndiff --git a/verdict.json b/verdict.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..e5a1966\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/verdict.json\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"e15fcacd647bb54155c7056356bf34e2238497e6\",\"verdict\":\"approve\",\"summary\":\"Test-only refactor: extract scanDevelopmentRoot from scanDevelopmentRoots and replace the host-dependent TestDiscoverLocalInstances with a deterministic mocked-checkout test. Production discovery behavior is unchanged; go test and go vet pass; Revision fast-forwards origin/master.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T17:54:59Z\"}\n\n=== verdict fbb9338e93e8b83963ed35a6fa287adb2fc8e5c6 ===\ncommit a03a3b8142e3f11144466d57666fcfb4bfac33e7\nAuthor: Iron Forest Verifier <verifier@forest.invalid>\nDate:   Fri Sep 4 13:29:36 2026 -0500\n\n    forest verdict fbb9338e93e8b83963ed35a6fa287adb2fc8e5c6\n\ndiff --git a/verdict.json b/verdict.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..bc8d344\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/verdict.json\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"fbb9338e93e8b83963ed35a6fa287adb2fc8e5c6\",\"verdict\":\"approve\",\"summary\":\"Checks test and vet pass (exit 0). Revision fast-forwards origin/master e15fcacd. Diff preserves explicit inventory during discovery reconciliation (app.go App.discovered) and gives startup-discovered instances exactly one worker (instanceWorker.started); added tests cover single-worker startup, worker cleanup after prune, and explicit retention. go test -race also passes. No blocking findings.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T18:28:42Z\"}\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788550565360}]}
