ndor HTMX, use no npm, retain no durable projection state, and expose no mutation routes.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-02T16:14:22.741Z\",\n          \"by\": \"none\",\n          \"text\": \"Accuracy correction from the current 1,168-row Ledger: historical aggregate agents are not limited to the configured roster and include blank and legacy/composite identities such as beaver,owl. The pane must derive Run filters and aggregate rows from returned data, not hardcode declaration names. Render blank identities as Unknown/legacy and non-roster identities as Historical/legacy while keeping the current declaration roster separate. Current observed whole-Ledger pass_rate is 0.6712328767123288; never substitute prototype metrics.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-02T16:41:34.699Z\",\n          \"by\": \"none\",\n          \"text\": \"Repository boundary selected by the operator: Canopy is a separate misty-step/canopy codebase. Iron Forest owns forest.cli.v2; Canopy owns explicit inventory, local/SSH collection, in-memory freshness state, Go HTTP/templates, vendored HTMX, and the read-only single pane. Integration is command/schema based, never Go imports or direct .forest reads.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-02T16:58:21.028Z\",\n          \"by\": \"canopy-prototype\",\n          \"text\": \"took\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-02T18:28:34.352Z\",\n          \"by\": \"canopy-prototype\",\n          \"text\": \"done: Published https://github.com/misty-step/canopy/commit/ae3d2b7. go test -race ./..., go vet ./..., go build, and node --check static/htmx.min.js passed. Live browser at 127.0.0.1:8080 read 1,196 Ledger Runs from current forest.cli.v2, preserved builder poll OK versus Run ERROR, rendered local fresh plus unreachable unknown, and showed retained, known-evicted, and unknown log states. HTMX 2.0.9 selection/poll swaps, keyboard focus order, 1440px desktop, and 390px mobile with 